# =============================================================================
# Git holds ONLY what a user needs to build/get/use the product (source, build
# files, README). All AI-agent and internal-process artifacts live in Diversion,
# never in git. Keep these lists in sync if new agent/internal files appear.
# =============================================================================

# AI / agent configs and memory (Diversion only)
.claude/
.diversion/
.dvignore
.remember/

# Internal dev / agent / process docs (not user-facing; Diversion only)
CLAUDE.md
STATUS.md
RECLAMATION_BACKLOG.md
TODO.md
IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
JUCE_PROJECT_DESIGN.md
REPO_CLEANUP_REPORT.md
docs/
python_version_archive/

# QA artifacts (local testing only)
qa_artifacts/

# Leaked API keys in JUCE example files
**/google-services.json
